{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"alirezarezvani--claude-skills--handoff-3235281b","name":"handoff","description":"Compact the current conversation into a handoff document for another agent to pick up. Save to a user-configured location (OS temp, home folder, or per-project .handoff/), redact secrets before write, suggest skills for the next session, and auto-load the latest handoff on the next SessionStart. First-run setup asks where to save so the project folder never gets cluttered. Use when the user says 'hand this off', 'handoff doc', 'summarize this for a new session', 'compact this conversation', 'I'm ending this session', 'pick this up later', or any variation signaling intent to pass work to a fresh agent. Also trigger on implicit signals: the user announcing they're switching machines, ending the day mid-task, or context is growing long without a natural stopping point.","category":"AI & agents","tags":["handoff","compact","current","conversation","into","document","another","agent","pick","up.","save","user","configured","location","os","temp","home","folder"],"repo":"alirezarezvani/claude-skills","owner":"alirezarezvani","stars":26382,"official":false,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94","path":"productivity/handoff/skills/handoff","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/tree/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/productivity/handoff/skills/handoff","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-26T13:53:02Z","fileCount":16,"bytes":97264,"sha256":"082a8f5e139c4b41a1a1b6bc50b5bcc9c2a0dbcbd2f09d0c275387b7546cf7b9","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"README.md","sourcePath":"productivity/handoff/skills/handoff/README.md","bytes":1204,"sha256":"7993b58420acd8b2ad4d689d5967c019f8820494115717bedd5cde793fc56b4f","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/alirezarezvani/claude-skills/19392f7a08264ed00486a251f5b2098321771f94/productivity/hando